  {% enddemo %}
</section>
<section aria-labelledby="use-h">
  <h2 id="use-h" class="type-h2">Using the stat strip</h2>
  <div class="rules">
    <div class="rule"><h3 class="type-h3">Do</h3><ul>
      <li>Give every number a source and a stated time window in the footnote.</li>
      <li>Keep numbers short enough to fit: a few digits and a symbol.</li>
      <li>Use a description list (<code>&lt;dl&gt;</code>) so a screen reader hears each label with its number.</li>
    </ul></div>
    <div class="rule"><h3 class="type-h3">Don't</h3><ul>
      <li>Use red for numbers. Red reads as "negative", even when a number going down is good.</li>
      <li>Show a number you cannot source.</li>
      <li>Use more than four stats.</li>
    </ul></div>
  </div>
</section>
